# Documentation

This directory contains the source and generated versions of the project
documentation.

- [`src/`](src/) — DocOnce source files, supporting material, and build scripts
- [`pub/`](pub/) — generated documents intended for publication
- [`web/`](web/) — entry point and supporting files for the published website

Documents are built from the files in `src/`. Generated output intended for
publication is copied to `pub/`.

For an overview of the project, see the
[main README](../README.md).
